SUMMARY:Deadline: Upe Foundation Curatorial Fellow at Gasworks 2027-2028 (L
 ondon\, GBP 32\,000\, Baltic connection)
DESCRIPTION:The Upe Foundation and Gasworks are recruiting a full-time Cura
 torial Fellow for 12 to 18 months\, embedded in Gasworks' curatorial team 
 in south London. The Fellow works closely with the artist selected for the
  2027 Gasworks residency for artists based in the Baltics and co-develops 
 their 2028 solo exhibition\, alongside wider exhibition\, registrar\, inte
 rpretation and residency duties. WHO: early-career curators with a connect
 ion to the Baltic region (Lithuania\, Latvia\, Estonia or their diasporas)
 \; Gasworks will consider visa sponsorship for this fixed-term role. WHAT 
 YOU GET: a GBP 32\,000 per year salary\, a 5% employer pension contributio
 n and up to GBP 250 towards relocation flights. APPLICATION: download the 
 job description and application form from the call page and upload the com
 pleted form\; questions to rosaharvest@gasworks.org.uk. DEADLINE: 9 Novemb
 er 2026\, 13:00 UK time.\n\nOrganisation: Upe Foundation (in partnership w
 ith Gasworks)\nLocation: London\, UK. For early-career curators with a con
 nection to the Baltic region (Lithuania\, Latvia\, Estonia or their diaspo
 ras)\; Gasworks will consider visa sponsorship.\nAward: GBP 32\,000 per ye
 ar salary\, 5% employer pension contribution\, relocation flights up to GB
 P 250 where relevant\, visa sponsorship considered. No application fee.\nD
 uration: Full-time fixed-term fellowship of 12 to 18 months\, spanning the
  2027 residency and 2028 solo exhibition.\n\nMore: https://gasworks.org.uk
 /opportunities/upe-foundation-curatorial-fellow?utm_source=artificialnouve
 augrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://gasworks.org.uk/opportunities/upe-foundation-curatorial-fellow?
 utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:London\, UK. For early-career curators with a connection to the Ba
 ltic region (Lithuania\, Latvia\, Estonia or their diasporas)\; Gasworks w
 ill consider visa sponsorship.
